<thead><tr><th>#3427's bullet</th><th>Status</th><th>Where it's already answered</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Semantically-named operations, no raw-command leakage</td><td>Ratified, shipped</td>
<td><code>docs/agent/platform-decisions.md#operations-declared-once-callers-generated</code> (#3031, clause 1)
+ <code>scripts/operations/registry.mjs</code>'s <code>op()</code> + two derived adapters
(<code>cli-adapter.mjs</code>, <code>http-adapter.mjs</code>)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Tiered by cost (three tiers discussed)</td><td>Already the closed step-kind vocabulary</td>
